WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.730
If only I had met you sooner...

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:35.740
Maybe I...

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:37.670
But...

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.010
I can't go back now.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.120
Goodbye, Bico.

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.440
Seriously?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.960
Ma'am...

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.770
You're wrong!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:57.430
I agree that nasty humans are to 
blame for your mother's death.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.910
But answering that with hatred is wrong!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.380
Bico-san!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.610
Please stop this!

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.820
Don't say goodbye to me, Teacher!

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.420
Teacher!

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.300
Yoichi...

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.350
<b>Article 11 
The Gamble</b>

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.340
I definitely felt that one.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.480
Damn, that hurt...

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.370
It's not like I agree with this, either.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.100
You heard the story, too, didn't you?

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.370
When Enchu betrayed us and attacked us,

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.420
he came after us with all his strength.

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.650
This is just the same.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.130
It's too late.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.160
Those who've sold their souls 
to messengers from Hell

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.160
can never be human again.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.350
Then how can we save her?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.560
According to precedent, our 
only choice is to judge her

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.880
in her half-spirit form, while 
her sins are still minor.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.250
In other words, she must go to Purgatory.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.410
Purgatory?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.150
Hey.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.820
Muhyo? You can stand?

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:16.420
Bico, you know how to make a potion that 
can temporarily restore depleted ren, right?

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.120
Huh? Restore ren?

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:23.170
Hang on! You need to have the Association 
treat your mental numbness!

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:25.920
Bico.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.080
The most secret of secret formulas...

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.810
Even among executors, 
it's virtually unknown.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.880
But I won't use it.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.070
I won't make ren that'll be 
used to kill my teacher.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.350
I can't do that.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:51.350
Not even if it would help her.

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:54.330
Who said it would kill her?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.380
Huh?

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.920
If she becomes an evil spirit, 
she'll have to go to Hell.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:04.470
But we may be able to do something 
about the forbidden magical law.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.930
This is a gamble.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.180
You're wasting your time.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.670
Roji, are you ready over there?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.440
Yes!

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:22.940
I'm done!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.390
All right!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.560
And here it comes!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.070
It'll be fine.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.820
I don't know what he's going to do,

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:36.580
but I do know that if anyone can 
save Rio-sensei, it's Muhyo.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:40.580
You're starting to sound like 
his assistant now, Roji.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:49.720
Here goes.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.620
Six-Direction Barrier Circle!

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:24.320
This is one of the most 
difficult potions to make.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.730
Be very careful when making it.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:39.190
Yoichi's barrier, eh? It's quite powerful.

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.890
But it won't hold out forever.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.410
Burst, Fireball!

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.590
You're struggling in vain.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.200
<i>Rio-sensei.</i>

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.430
Madoka-sama?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.440
Hurry, Rio-sensei.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.310
Muhyo is about to try something.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.930
Wow... I've never seen a circle before.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.760
It's blocking her attack completely!

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:39.810
It has several times more defensive 
power than a Spirit Barrier.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:40.990
Several times?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:46.500
A Six-Direction Barrier Circle 
is one of the strongest barriers.

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:50.280
Of course, only judges can use circles.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.010
There are different types.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.670
Outside of barriers,

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:58.220
<b>Circle</b>

00:08:53.720 --> 00:09:00.010
<b>Gate</b>

00:08:54.300 --> 00:09:00.010
<b>Barrier</b>

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:58.060
there are also gates, which executors 
use to summon messengers.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.010
If you can do that,

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.160
it'll make life much easier for 
the executor you work with.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.420
Are you all right?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.070
Yeah...

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:11.530
But these circles are tricky.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:15.000
They take a lot of ren from you.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.240
Yoichi-san!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:21.910
Is Bico gonna be a while yet?

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:24.620
I can't hold out much longer.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:25.410
Bico-san!

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.210
Is the medicine ready yet?!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.470
A bit longer.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.940
What's this stuff?

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.920
Defective ren that wouldn't mix.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.340
Looks like I got the amount wrong.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.620
You're not really gonna 
screw this up, are you?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.560
Don't worry.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.260
Muhyo, pour those in here slowly.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.190
Wait, that's too much...

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.160
Whoa! Did you mess it up?!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:54.190
Come on, guys! I'm gonna 
give out any second now.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.860
This isn't good...

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.780
The barrier is screaming?

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.860
I did it...

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.530
The secret potion, Ren Source Spring.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.290
Ren Source Spring

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.560
That's the medicine that can restore ren?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:18.680
My teacher told me that its origins 
can be traced back about 700 years.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.460
It was quite an intense battle.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.420
The spirits numbered in 
the tens of thousands,

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:27.620
and the Association only a few thousand.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.110
Just when the executors had 
exhausted their strength,

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:32.980
it was Ren Source Spring that saved the day.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:37.190
But this is the important part, Bico.

00:10:37.720 --> 00:10:40.680
This potion can also be 
poison to the human body.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:41.450
Poison?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.830
700 years ago, hundreds of executors died

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.720
from taking too much of it.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.380
If it ever becomes necessary, 
use only a tiny bit.

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.890
You shouldn't use it at all 
if you can avoid it.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.720
Come on, don't run away, Bico!

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.640
So you should use as little 
as possible, Muhyo.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.200
Yeah, just a little—

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:14.400
H-He drank it all...

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.400
Now, then...

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.430
His eyes are back to normal!

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.360
Muhyo...

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.900
That was pretty gross,

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:29.330
but I'm sleepy, so I must 
have some of my ren back.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.320
Bu—

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.330
Muhyo.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.750
Good work.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.820
Muhyo...

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:39.980
Yoichi, when the next attack 
is over, release the circle.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:42.590
You got it, Executor Muhyo!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:46.470
Muhyo, are you really okay?

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.480
Now!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.950
<b>Hades's Banquet</b>

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.950
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.960
<b>Spirit Striker</b>

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.960
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:25.970
Muhyo... You recovered from 
your mental numbness?

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.720
That stick of yours is in my way.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.220
I declare Special Magical Law, Clause 6...

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.640
Anesthetic Needles!

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.770
No...

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.610
Roji, destroy her staff!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.740
On it!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.480
The Fire Salamander disappeared!

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:52.790
Teacher!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.340
How bad is it?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.830
Thankfully, the trees broke her fall, 
so her injuries aren't serious.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.840
But she's badly burned.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:08.040
She was pushing herself too 
hard to use that staff.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.850
Anesthetic Needles will keep her asleep 
for three full days, right?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:15.500
I made them weak enough 
to just knock her out.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.510
It'll make her easier to treat.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:22.680
Yoichi, can you put down
 a Messenger Gate circle?

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:25.450
Huh? Yeah, I guess so, but...

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:30.820
Muhyo, would you just tell 
me what you plan to do?

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.060
We might not have a lot of confidence...

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.710
But we're all betting on 
what little hope there is.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:46.360
I was actually saving this method for him...

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.220
I never thought I'd have to use it here.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:55.390
We defeat the messenger she made
 the forbidden magical law contract with,

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.480
and render the contract blank.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.560
Y-You're kidding!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:00.730
Defeat...

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.150
...the messenger?!

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:07.400
Incidentally, no one has 
ever tried this before.

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.600
Messenger versus messenger, huh?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.740
That's a pretty horrific method...

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.790
But I guess contemplating won't help.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.290
Let's do this for Rio-sensei.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:22.290
Right.

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.300
Hey, Roji!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.810
Hold that end tight.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.360
We don't have much of this tape left.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:39.290
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.310
I'm counting on you.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:42.900
<i>I'm scared, Muhyo.</i>

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:48.940
<i>Fighting a messenger is way outside 
the scope of a magical lawyer's work.</i>

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:53.070
<i>If... If, this time,</i>

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.460
<i>Muhyo actually dies...</i>

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.460
<i>I...</i>

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:05.060
Huh? What's a work travel 
magic circle doing here?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.710
Hey, Bico.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.970
Is this one of your—

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.610
You really are tough, Muhyo.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.230
That's...

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.690
the guy from the library...

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.980
Nice to see you all together.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.500
I'm sorry...

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.620
It's all right.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:43.630
You're always floating onto
 the scene like some jellyfish,

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:45.130
Enchu.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:47.380
That's Enchu?

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.070
A jellyfish, huh? I guess you're right.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:55.890
You say the funniest things.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.190
When did he get here?!

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:59.270
I think...

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.770
that magic circle is Teacher's.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:06.600
Madoka-sama, I'm sorry you 
had to travel so far.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.590
I told you to use it if it became necessary,

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:13.030
but I never thought it'd 
really come to that.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:18.600
Still, I'm impressed you could 
use a magical tool while under

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.380
the effects of Anesthetic Needles.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.540
Thanks to you, I didn't have 
to waste my own strength.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.800
That's the great thing about fellow 
forbidden magical law users.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.060
Hang in there, Maeda-san!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.460
I'm amazed you're safe yourself, Imai-san.

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.020
Well, I am a pro.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:49.930
Imai-san, there's something I must tell you.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.140
The truth is, just moments ago,

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.920
I saw someone open the 
gate to the magic prison,

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.830
and I said nothing.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.230
I couldn't act.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:07.330
Amidst the hellfire, the one 
opening it looked at me and...

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.360
laughed.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.720
Enchu! How dare you do this to my teacher?!

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.840
Now, don't be rude, Bico.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:28.580
She approached me of her own will,

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.840
after abandoning the Association 
that let her mother die.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:37.740
It's true that there are plenty of 
corrupt scumbags in the Association,

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.240
but not all of them are!

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.960
Rio-sensei was so worried about her mother,

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:45.670
she only dealt with the 
executors who were nearby.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:48.250
It was bad luck.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.550
All the executors in that 
neighborhood were scum.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.390
That's why...

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.090
Okouchi Sosei...

00:17:58.740 --> 00:17:59.760
Lily Elena...

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:01.850
Those two...

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.100
were killed!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:36.520
Welcome, Rio-sensei.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.980
Madoka-sama...

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:46.760
Rio-sensei...

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.360
Enchu! You got your revenge, didn't you?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.150
So you've got no reason
 to do evil any longer!

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:02.450
Hey, Bico. Scoot over a bit.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.570
Enchu! Rio-sensei!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.910
Both of you, open your eyes already!

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:13.840
All right! It worked!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.670
Was that...

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.600
When an executor taps his text twice,

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.720
it's a sign to create a blind spot.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.810
We learned that at MLS.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:25.680
Amazing!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.280
Muhyo and Yoichi working as a duo...

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.720
You got me.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.190
But...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:39.400
These don't have much effect on 
me anymore, I'm sorry to say.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:44.450
I know Anesthetic Needles are one of the few
 magical laws used between humans.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:47.150
The Anesthetic Needles didn't work?

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:47.950
Oh, no!

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:53.790
I thought it was weird with 
Rio, too, but now I get it.

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.650
You're barely human at all anymore, are you?

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:00.400
I envision it every single day.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:03.800
When I sleep, when I look at the sky...

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.850
I see you.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.950
And look at this.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.600
I can even do this now.

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.280
That's...

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.680
I can do several difficult 
tasks at one time.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.470
It's quite convenient.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.620
By the way,

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:24.860
did you summon that circle to destroy 
a forbidden magical law contract?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.200
It might still work for Rio-sensei.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:34.460
But I think it's a bit 
too late for me, Muhyo.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.950
Splendid work, Madoka-sama!

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.520
I never could have done this!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.980
And now it's my turn to get to work...

00:20:58.800 --> 00:20:59.480
Who is that?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:05.700
Now, come to me. Become one.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.850
Something crazy just popped up over there!

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:29.600
It's coming from the magic prison.

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:30.850
What is it?

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.640
Aren't the souls of those spirits beautiful?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.350
Come this way. Your dinner is over here.

00:21:48.760 --> 00:21:51.120
That's gonna be trouble!

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.860
Enchu...

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:42.330
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:43.270
Article 12:

00:23:44.260 --> 00:23:46.170
"Swallows in the Wind."

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:48.940
Magical law will be enforced.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Article 12 
Swallows in the Wind</b>
